<section id="agent-2-coordinate-resolver" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="agent-2-coordinate-resolver">Agent 2: Coordinate Resolver</h2>
<p><strong>Purpose</strong>: Convert beach names to precise geographic coordinates</p>
<p><strong>Functionality</strong>: - Takes beach name and description context - Uses GPT-4o-mini with coordinate-resolution prompting - Validates coordinate ranges (±90° latitude, ±180° longitude) - Handles ambiguous beach names through context</p>
<p><strong>Input</strong>: Beach name + description context</p>
