<section id="agent-3-weather-data-fetcher" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="agent-3-weather-data-fetcher">Agent 3: Weather Data Fetcher</h2>
<p><strong>Purpose</strong>: Retrieve real-time swell and wind data from dual APIs</p>
<p><strong>Functionality</strong>: - Makes <strong>two separate API calls</strong> (critical architectural decision): - <strong>Marine API</strong> (<code>marine-api.open-meteo.com/v1/marine</code>): - Wave height (meters) - Wave period (seconds) - Wave direction (degrees)</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Weather API</strong> (<code>api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast</code>):
<ul>
<li>Wind speed at 10m (km/h)</li>
<li>Wind direction (degrees)</li>
</ul></li>
<li>Merges hourly data from both sources</li>
<li>Computes daily maximum values</li>
<li>Includes proper error handling with graceful fallbacks</li>
</ul>
