<section id="agent-4-forecast-synthesizer" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="agent-4-forecast-synthesizer">Agent 4: Forecast Synthesizer</h2>
<p><strong>Purpose</strong>: Create human-readable forecast text using AI analysis</p>
<p><strong>Functionality</strong>: - Accepts all weather data and beach context - Prompts GPT-4o-mini for professional forecast generation - Considers: - Wave conditions (height, period, direction) - Wind patterns and their effect on conditions - Optimal surfing windows - Safety considerations</p>
<p><strong>Input</strong>: All previous agent outputs + merged weather data</p>
<p><strong>Output</strong>:</p>
<pre><code>Tomorrow looks excellent for the exposed reefs with 
2-3m swells and light offshore winds in the morning. 
Conditions clean up until midday, with ideal wind 
switching onshore in the afternoon. Best windows: 
early dawn to 11am. Crowds expected.</code></pre>
